{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼まいまいとにらめっこ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の問題の答え！\nA1:まあや\nA2:ゆったん\nでした！\n難しすぎて答えてなかった人\nいたでしょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日4thシングルの発売日でした！\nみなさんさっそく感想\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n今日はいくちゃんのビバーチェ肉に\nついて話します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のレッスンで\nいくちゃんがBLTTシャツを\n着てたのよ。\nそのTシャツにかいてある「vivace」\nの意味がわからなかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま「いくちゃんそれなんて\n書いてあるの？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"い「ビバーチェっていうんだよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま「何それー楽器の名前？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"い「ううん違うよ\nビバーチェっていうお肉だよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま「...え？！！！\nいくちゃん...Tシャツに肉の名前\n書いたの？！下にピアノの絵が\n書いてあるのに？！(さすが天然だな)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツにそんなこと書いちゃう\nいくちゃんがかわいくて爆笑。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま「ちょっとあとでそのビバーチェ肉\n検索してみるわ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...といって一人で笑ってたら\n堪えきれなくなったのか\nいくちゃんも爆笑。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビバーチェ【 vivace】\n音楽の速度標語の一。アレグロと\n同じかやや速いテンポを指示する。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...完全にからかわれてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビバーチェ肉を美味しそうだと\n思っちゃう私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVで万理華また\n歌ってるけどタイトルは何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近くでテレホン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭の良いメンバーは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のイメージだと...れなだなあ。\nみくも、れいか、いくちゃん、ちまも\n頭良いイメージ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVみて思ったんやけど\n英語苦手ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手というか！\nそんなん普通にペラペラ\nしゃべれた方がおかしいやん？！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物の森新しいのはやらないの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...やらない。\n夢中になってまた目悪くしちゃうっ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近寒くてなかなか起きれないの...\nどうすれば早く起きれるかなー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるううう\n起きてるけど、布団から出たく\nないよねー！...て違う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早起きは気合だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...遅刻魔のまりっかに聞いても\n参考にならないね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日からまりっか推しに\nなってもいいですかー？(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会入会ですね。\nもちろんです。嬉しいです。\nなってください！\nというかなりましょう！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何て呼ばれるのが一番嬉しいかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷ったらまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩むってなんだと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいです。\n私は、悩んで悩んでその後\n結論が出たとしてもまた\nその先について悩んでしまいます。\nえ？じゃあそれってこういうこと\nじゃない？って..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから友達とかと悩んでることに\nついて話してても、最後は\n「んーなんか人間って複雑だね」\nで終わってしまうんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩むとか考えるって\n人間が毎日やってることだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ書いてるときも思ってるけど...\nどうやって書こうか悩んでます笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじめっくさいぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香水つけてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はつけません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「制服のマネキン」の略称は\n何と言ってる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーマネキン！\n走れ！Bicycleもそうだけど、\nバイシクルって呼んでる笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いーのよいーのよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼び方は自由よ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肉まん、あんまん、ピザまん\nとかの中で何派？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...これは...\nあんまん食べたい～♪(c)\nというべきなのか...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......ええーーーーい！\n今の気分は肉まんじゃああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生思い通りにいく方と\nいかない方、どっち派ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー何もかも全部思い通りに\nいってたら苦労とかそんな言葉も\nないよー。全部思い通りにいったら\n達成感もないだろうな。\n思い通りにいくなんて\n想像つかないから\nいかない方！ですね。\n...ってこの質問はつまり\nどういうことだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/19/2692812/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}